Source: curlog
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Eugene Tihonov <tihonov.ea@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, libwayland-dev, libwayland-bin
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/tihonove/curlog
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: curlog
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: log the Wayland pointer position and clicks as JSONL
 Pointer position comes from the compositor via an ext-image-copy-capture
 cursor session; clicks are read from /dev/input. Ships a udev rule that
 gives the active session access to mice, touchpads and trackpoints
 (keyboards stay closed).
